<p>Right now, we can say 4 is a candidate as it might be the next largest n=
umber of values to its left. No candidates have been encountered before 4 b=
ecause it=E2=80=99s the rightmost element, so we should mark the result for=
 4 in res as -1:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: left;"=
><img alt=3D"Image represents a Cartesian coordinate system illustrating a =
