yle=3D"color: transparent;"></div></figure>
<p>Since we removed all candidates smaller than 3, the rightmost candidate =
is now 4. So, let=E2=80=99s record 4 as the next largest number of 3 in res=
 and add 3 to the candidates list:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: left;"=
