and increases with each subsequent point, indicating a trend.  Separately, =
a rectangular box displays the array `candidates =3D [4, 3, 2, 1]`, which i=
s labeled as 'decreasing,' indicating the array's elements are in descendin=
g order. An orange arrow points from the `candidates` array to the right, v=
